      "review_summary": "The PR blocks all workspace-loaded `CLOUDSDK_*` variables, clears inherited `CLOUDSDK_PYTHON_ARGS` for Gmail `gcloud` launches, and makes explicit `undefined` child-environment overrides remove inherited keys.\n\nPR surface: Source +3, Tests +34. Total +37 across 6 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main loads Cloud SDK workspace controls beyond `CLOUDSDK_PYTHON` and ignores the Gmail caller's explicit unset request. The contributor also supplied exact-change-head after-fix proof with a real `gcloud`, though no before-fix live exploit transcript was captured.",
